.TH ZDOTS-KEYCHAIN 1 "2026-07-21" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
zdots-keychain \- zdots\-keychain — manage zdots secrets in macOS Keychain
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBzdots-keychain --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
zdots-keychain — manage zdots secrets in macOS Keychain

Commands:
  add VARNAME VALUE    store or update a secret
  get VARNAME          print a secret value
  delete VARNAME       remove a secret entry
  list                 list all stored variable names
  migrate              import .zdots.secrets literal values into Keychain
  verify               confirm all .zdots.secrets vars resolve to non-empty values

Secrets are stored under service "zdots" in your login Keychain.
Variable names are used as the account name (e.g., MAXMIND_LICENSE_KEY).

On a fresh machine:
  1. zdots-keychain add VARNAME VALUE   (for each secret)
  OR
  1. Restore from Keychain backup / 1Password / etc.

Then verify:
  zdots-keychain verify
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
agent-guide(1), zdots-doctor(1)
